(text "SIG labels refer to the 16 existing PCB feed networks; each feeds 8 printed patches.\nAll 128 patch copper rectangles, array spacing and the 4-layer board are retained.\nConnector specification: DC-6 GHz. Operation of the 10.5 GHz antenna with this interface is unverified."
